  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/12/IMG_4193.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(76 fotos) Lleno total la noche de este s&aacute;bado en el pub D&eacute;cada, en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 110 de Onda, durante el concierto de flamenquito del grupo local De Calle. Mucho baile de rumbas y sevillanas, y mucha animaci&oacute;n,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/12/IMG_4236.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>incluido el grupo de la quinta de Suera que en 2015 ha cumplido 50 a&ntilde;os.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdecalledecada/img_4173.jpg\" alt=\"img_4173\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdecalledecada/img_4174.jpg\" alt=\"img_4174\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdecalledecada/img_4175.jpg\" alt=\"img_4175\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdecalledecada/img_4176.jpg\" alt=\"img_4176\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdecalledecada/img_4177.jpg\" alt=\"img_4177\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdecalledecada/img_4178.jpg\" alt=\"img_4178\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdecalledecada/img_4179.jpg\" alt=\"img_4179\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertdecalledecada/img_4180.jpg\" alt=\"img_4180\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img 